#: app/Resources/Options.php:2067
msgid "Default Fallback Image URL"
msgstr "URL изображения по умолчанию"

#: app/Resources/Options.php:2071
msgid "Image used when an importer is configured to use a fallback instead of (or in addition to) source photos. Paste any publicly-reachable image URL. Leave empty to disable the fallback option."
